[module ControlFlow('http://example.com')]

[template main()]
=== MTL Control Flow Examples ===

1. If Statement (true condition):
[if (true)]
   ✓ This branch is executed
[else]
   ✗ This branch is NOT executed
[/if]

2. If Statement (false condition):
[if (false)]
   ✗ This branch is NOT executed
[else]
   ✓ This branch is executed
[/if]

3. If/ElseIf/Else:
[let value = 15]
[if (value < 10)]
   Value is less than 10
[elseif (value < 20)]
   Value is between 10 and 20 (current: [value/])
[else]
   Value is 20 or greater
[/if]
[/let]

4. Let Bindings:
[let firstName = 'John']
[let lastName = 'Doe']
   Full Name: [firstName + ' ' + lastName/]
[/let]
[/let]
[/template]
